  "heroTitle": "Where do you stand in<br><em>Irish</em> politics?",
  "heroSub": "70 statements on the issues defining Ireland right now: housing, immigration, a united Ireland, neutrality, and health. Every position is asked twice with opposite framing, revealing both your party alignment and your framing bias.",
  "partyStripHtml": "<div class=\"party-strip\">\n    <div class=\"party-cell\">\n      <div class=\"party-dot\" style=\"background:#005A9C\"></div>\n      <div class=\"party-name\">Fine Gael</div>\n      <div class=\"party-desc\">Your answers most closely align with Fine Gael. You favour a pro-business environment, low corporate taxes, fiscal restraint, and socially progressive values.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"party-cell\">\n      <div class=\"party-dot\" style=\"background:#66BB66\"></div>\n      <div class=\"party-name\">Fianna Fáil</div>\n      <div class=\"party-desc\">Your answers most closely align with Fianna Fáil. You represent a centrist republican position that balances support for business with state-backed housing initiatives.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"party-cell\">\n      <div class=\"party-dot\" style=\"background:#006644\"></div>\n      <div class=\"party-name\">Sinn Féin</div>\n      <div class=\"party-desc\">Your answers most closely align with Sinn Féin. You strongly advocate for Irish reunification, massive state builds in housing, wealth taxes, and protecting Irish neutrality.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"party-cell\">\n      <div class=\"party-dot\" style=\"background:#449944\"></div>\n      <div class=\"party-name\">Green Party</div>\n      <div class=\"party-desc\">Your answers most closely align with the Green Party. You prioritise aggressive carbon reduction, cycling infrastructure, and sustainable economic reform.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"party-cell\">\n      <div class=\"party-dot\" style=\"background:#CC0000\"></div>\n      <div class=\"party-name\">Labour Party</div>\n      <div class=\"party-desc\">Your answers most closely align with the Labour Party. You support workers' rights, enhanced public services, and progressive social taxation.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"party-cell\">\n      <div class=\"party-dot\" style=\"background:#7B2E8D\"></div>\n      <div class=\"party-name\">Social Democrats</div>\n      <div class=\"party-desc\">Your answers most closely align with the Social Democrats. You want universal healthcare (Sláintecare), strict political accountability, and massive public housing investment.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>"
